## Patch notes for 2026.157.123

These patch notes summarize the changes from version 154.0.181.

Added 6 new endpoints:
* Discussion.CreateTaskComments
* Integration.UpdateIntegrationMetadata
* Project.RestoreProject
* Risk.CreateRisk
* Task.MarkTaskAsReadForTheCurrentUser
* WorkSpace.UpdateSettingsForTheCurrentWorkspace

Renamed 1 endpoints:
* Renamed WorkSpace.RetrieveWorkspaces to WorkSpace.RetrieveTheCurrentWorkspace

Changes to existing endpoints:
* Breaking change: TaskField.RetrieveTaskFieldValue path changed from `/api/data/tasks/{taskId}/fields/{fieldId}/values` to `/api/data/tasks/{taskId}/fields/{fieldId}`
* Breaking change: TaskField.UpdateTaskFieldValue path changed from `/api/data/tasks/{taskId}/fields/{fieldId}/values` to `/api/data/tasks/{taskId}/fields/{fieldId}`
* Breaking change: TaskStatus.UpdateTaskStatus path changed from `/api/data/tasks/statuses/{taskStatusId}` to `/api/data/projects/{projectId}/tasks/statuses`
* TaskStatus.UpdateTaskStatus added path parameter `projectId`
* TaskStatus.UpdateTaskStatus removed path parameter `taskStatusId`
* Breaking change: TaskStatus.DeleteTaskStatus path changed from `/api/data/tasks/statuses/{taskStatusId}` to `/api/data/projects/{projectId}/tasks/statuses/{taskStatusId}`
* TaskStatus.DeleteTaskStatus added path parameter `projectId`

Changes to data models:
* IntegrationDto: Added new field `metadata`
* IntegrationProviderDto: Added new field `unauthorized`
* MeetingUpdateDto: Added new field `moveToProject`
* NptUpdateDto: Added new field `moveToProject`
* ResourceCreateDto: Added new field `defaultPlannedHours`
* ResourceCreateDto: Added new field `workingDays`
* ResourceDto: Added new field `defaultPlannedHours`
* ResourceDto: Added new field `workingDays`
* ResourceUpdateDto: Added new field `defaultPlannedHours`
* ResourceUpdateDto: Added new field `workingDays`
* RiskUpdateDto: Added new field `moveToProject`
* TaskDetailsDto: Added new field `baseline`
* TaskFileDto: Added new field `size`
* TaskUpdateDto: Added new field `moveToProject`
* WorkSpaceDto: Added new field `settings`
* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Added new field `entitlements`

Deprecated 2 old endpoints:
* Dashboard.RetrieveDashboardUserSettings
* Dashboard.CreateOrUpdateUserDashboardSettings


